  "id": "courgette-and-cherry-salad",
  "name": "Courgette and Cherry Salad",
  "subtitle": "Roasted courgettes, fresh cherries, greens, and feta with a sharp molasses dressing.",
  "description": "A colorful summer salad combining roasted courgettes and toasted seeds with crisp leaves, tomatoes, cherries, herbs, feta, and a tangy dressing.",
